I'd like to propose adding a generic event filter that would allow developers to show/hide events with criteria beyond what the filterEventsWithResources option provides. For example, with the `filterEvents`, we could implement a simple search feature like so:

```html
<p>
<input id="input" placeholder="Filter events"/>
</p>

<main class="row">
    <div id="ec" class="col"></div>
</main>
```

```js
